And I think that's what chess master is missing is that it needed a little more personality, fun, and maybe even some twists on chess included.

00:38:12.100 --> 00:38:23.460
Even just as bonus modes or minigames or something, especially this early in video game history, it just feels like this game is taking itself way too seriously and was probably better as a computer application.

